          "Desc": "· Boss Anomaly DMG taken is <color=#2BAD00>reduced by 30%</color>. When switching from <Term:2000002> state to normal state, or from normal state to <Term:2000002> state, Agent CRIT DMG against them is <color=#2BAD00>increased by 20%</color>. This effect can stack up to 3 times and resets when the boss recovers from Stun."
        },
        "69012705": {
          "Title": "",
          "Desc": "·Triggering <color=#FFAF2C>Miasmic Shield Purification</color> grants <color=#FFAF2C>1,000 Performance Points</color>. During the <Term:2000003>, each successful counter against the Boss's attacks grants <color=#FFAF2C>500 Performance Points</color>. Performing a <color=#FFAF2C>Shutdown</color> on the Boss's <Term:2000003> grants <color=#FFAF2C>2,000 Performance Points</color>. Maximum obtainable Performance Points: 5,000."
        },
